# L §7.6 item 1 (tally 2.1.6, issue #89): the last key of a day range by 7 from 9999-12-01 is a period
# 9999-12-29 to 10000-01-04, past 9999-12-31: LOAD-LIMIT, since load builds an index's keys (§8.3 item 5). tally
# 2.1.5's refcore refused it REFCORE-NOT-YET (OverflowError).
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index ds = day 9999-12-01..9999-12-31 by 7

ask n: max(pos(k) for k in ds)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LIMIT index ds: a day passes 9999-12-31 (m.tally:9)
